{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An avatar element that can be used at the leading or trailing position of a list item"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSStaticListItem"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSNavigationListItem"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSListItemAvatar"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemAvatar","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" displays a circular visual identifier that can represent a user, a contact,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or any entity. It supports three content types: a predefined icon, a custom image, or text initials."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An optional "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeIcon","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be attached at the bottom-trailing corner to indicate status."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Avatar-types","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Avatar types"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemAvatar\/AvatarType","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the content displayed inside the avatar:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".icon"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A predefined person\/people icon from the current theme’s resource bundle.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".image(_:)"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A custom ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Image"},{"text":" asset that fills the avatar circle.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".initials(_:)"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A short text string (2 characters maximum) rendered centered in the avatar.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Sizes","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Sizes"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemAvatar\/Size","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the available sizes for the avatar:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The default size, suited for standard list items.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".large"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A larger variant for increased visual prominence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".extraLarge"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The largest variant, typically used for profile-like displays.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" When the avatar is embedded in a list item with small size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(via "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/SwiftUICore\/View\/oudsListItemSize(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"size"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"ignored","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the avatar is always rendered at its smallest available size."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Badge","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Badge"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional badge "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeIcon","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be placed at the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bottom-trailing corner of the avatar to convey status information (e.g. online presence, notification count)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The badge is rendered with a safety-area border matching the theme’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"controlItem.colorBadgeSafetyArea"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The recommended badge sizes per avatar size are:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"},{"text":" avatar → ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".extraSmall"},{"text":" badge","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".large"},{"text":" avatar → ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".small"},{"text":" badge","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".extraLarge"},{"text":" avatar → ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"},{"text":" badge","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Code samples"},{"code":["    \/\/ Avatar with predefined icon, medium size","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .icon, size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Avatar with a custom image, large size","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .image(Image(\"il_placeholder\")), size: .large)","","    \/\/ Avatar with initials, extra large size","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .initials(\"AB\"), size: .extraLarge)","","    \/\/ Avatar with icon and a notification badge","    let badgeType = .standard(.init(accessibilityLabel: \"Do not disturb\", status: .negative, size: .small))","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .icon, size: .medium, badgeType: badgeType)","","    \/\/ Avatar with initials and a icon badge with positive status","    let badgeType = .icon(.init(status: .positive, accessibilityLable: \"Online\", size: .small))","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .initials(\"JD\"), size: .large, badgeType: badgeType)","","    \/\/ Usage as leading element in a list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: \"John Doe\", description: \"Online\"),","        leading: .avatar(OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .icon, size: .medium))","    )","","    \/\/ Usage as trailing element in a list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: \"Contact\"),","        trailing: .avatar(OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .initials(\"AB\"), size: .medium))","    )"],"syntax":"swift","